  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 模组。充满爱意打造。为 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>Biome Spawn Point（生物群系出生点）允许指定在新世界生成时玩家应在哪个生物群系出生。此功能适用于原版生物群系，也支持模组添加的生物群系。由于通过数据包添加生物群系的特性，你需要首次生成一次新世界以生成 spawnbiomes.txt 配置文件。之后，你可以通过移除生物群系名称行前的感叹号来选择玩家应该在哪些生物群系出生。<br><br>兼容奖励箱世界生成功能。若启用，将在生物群系出生点附近额外放置一个奖励箱。<br><br>本模组与 <span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/village-spawn-point\">Village Spawn Point</a></span> 兼容。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/customization-bundle.svg&w=832\" alt=\"包含在 Serilum 的自定义套件中\" width=\"416\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"环境：服务端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可配置项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的配置选项：</p>\n<details><summary>展开查看配置</summary>\n<p><span>配置文件将生成于 <em>./config/biomespawnpoint/spawnbiomes.txt</em>。移除生物群系名称前的感叹号，即可增加玩家在该生物群系出生的概率。仅选中一项时，概率为 100%；选中两项时，每项概率各为 50%。</span><strong> <br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/biome-spawn-point/a.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"注意事项与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>你可以在任何整合包中自由使用本模组，前提是下载源必须保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态内。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><span><br>如有问题、建议或想法，请访问我们的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 仓库</a>。感谢支持！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
